{"id":"n25597-1-12","stage":3,"title":"고춧가루 · 辣椒面","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25597-1-12-1","ko":"점심에 뭐 먹었길래 이 사이에 고춧가루가 끼었니?","zh":"中午吃了什么，牙缝里夹着辣椒粉？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"점심에","meaning":"中午","explanation":"점심：中午；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"2","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점심에","audio":"/audio/986cc2e503e6256b1f53.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}},{"text":"먹었길래","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；길래：说明说话人据以采取行动的原因或发现。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹었길래","audio":"/audio/9f7994859c92e871b6df.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"사이에","meaning":"间，之间，……的时候","explanation":"사이：间，之间，……的时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"2","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이에","audio":"/audio/088d82d3555d167bc296.mp3"}},{"text":"고춧가루가","meaning":"辣椒面，辣椒粉","explanation":"고춧가루：辣椒面，辣椒粉；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고춧가루","audio":"/audio/db344563a8a6de08d7af.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25597","senseId":"